body:
Ok; so this looks like a bug in Jandex.

In `org.jboss.jandex.MethodParameterTypeTarget`:

```
    @Override
    public MethodInfo enclosingTarget() {
        return (MethodInfo) super.enclosingTarget();
    }
```

For an annotated parameter in a constructor, `super.enclosingTarget()` returns a `ClassInfo` representing the class declaring the constructor, instead of representing the constructor itself. This seems wrong, and anyway it causes the cast to fail.

I'll look into writing a reproducer for Jandex and reporting this.
